Description: A TUI that helps you configure your server to stop bad bots and still allow
 good bots.
 A TUI, a web UI and a CLI that help you configure your server to stop bad bots
 without hiding behind a CDN. It classifies known bots by category and blocks
 them in your NGINX config, and renders an nftables or iptables script that
 blocks countries, datacenter ranges and addresses caught scanning your logs.
 Nothing is applied without being asked.

